    <description>The Divine Diurganate weapon, symbolizing the destruction of authority by the Holy Twin-tail, has only been produced in small quantities. It needs a little time to warm up before it can emit a powerful beam of penetrating light to burn through the enemies in front of it. The Catholic Church strictly keeps secret the operation method of this weapon, so the ratkins have no idea how this firestick embedded with several stones can kill and injure enemy troops.</description>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
